  (text "eMMC and its processor-side IO supply, in a file of their own (2026-11-18) so that commander_cpu_ram can share them\n(its src/netlist/shared.txt).  Moved here unchanged from 05_soc_usb_emmc.net and 19_storage_misc.net; the parts keep\ntheir sheets (soc_usb, storage), so the mainboard's schematic and board see the same parts in the same places.\n\n--- U1I VCCIO2 (eMMC/FSPI) domain: unpopulated on the 3E; Commander adds eMMC ---" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 25.4 0)
